{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2015-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1447632000, "end_date": 1448236799, "month_true_total": 189, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:10:47 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "19225585", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150991747", "personaname": "Samurai_Kraken", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198150991747/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7498, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6086, "last_played": 1530566583, "avatar": "5d2541364dbdc0bc1b2d8311b2d2c02780b5252b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Highly recommend this game\nGreat soundtrack\nGreat gameplay\nGreat classes\nGreat items\nAll around Tony the Tiger approved", "timestamp_created": 1448234976, "timestamp_updated": 1448234976, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19225130", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010052915", "personaname": "Shai Hulud", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010052915/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 4245, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1242, "last_played": 1597162295, "avatar": "ad609c8f8d253e52dd5c62837e4aa39383b996fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "Epic Video Game", "timestamp_created": 1448232865, "timestamp_updated": 1448232865, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19224740", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042667440", "personaname": "Project571", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042667440/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1946, "last_played": 1536967750, "avatar": "fd2cc333eed3c555e9c503ac0fe8ed68c1902435"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly this game is one of the better games I have ever played. The game has good music, multiple maps with secrets on each, interesting characters, and is extremely fun to play with friends. The difficulty increasing as time goes on makes the game even more intense because on higher difficulties you have to decide if it is worth it to look for random chests to spend your money on before teleporting onwards. The final level was one of my favorite things because of the ability to use some of the things from the different wings on the ship. I didn't see that at first but once I found it, I had even more fun trying to bait him into the cannon's fire range. The music really fits each level and the levels themselves are pretty amazing. The art fits the style the devs were going for IMO and the bosses were pretty cool. The only downside to this game that I can think of is that if someone gets behind enough the game becomes you having to kite the enemies around until you slowly kill them or die, but even this isn't too bad because it is really exciting to try and run from the enemies and pick them off without dying. I would recommend this game to anyone who enjoys a challenge, a neat story, and Hack N Slash fighting. 9.5/10", "timestamp_created": 1448231326, "timestamp_updated": 1448231326, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19222298", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033183108", "personaname": "Ultimata", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ultimata/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3452, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3165, "last_played": 1673463459, "avatar": "9d555d6177ef6aa0479793af7a548818a80a1ba5"}, "language": "english", "review": "An excelent game that everyone should play at least once.", "timestamp_created": 1448222343, "timestamp_updated": 1448222343, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19215349", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971043633", "personaname": "Original Mr B", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971043633/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1126, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 980, "last_played": 1555957383, "avatar": "3ed81351de9e71c56da801b5802f438956e345d3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Didn't like it at first but definitely grew on me. Really fun game and quite addictive. If you like hard games you'll like this.", "timestamp_created": 1448200561, "timestamp_updated": 1448200561, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}